    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Founder-run London graphic design studio founded 2009 by Eva Kellenberger (RCA, Camberwell) and Sebastian White (CSM, RCA), with a 4-person core team. Senior/director level throughout; Eva and Sebastian are deeply hands-on across every project, working for major cultural institutions (V&A, Barbican, Tate, British Museum, Courtauld, Goldsmiths CCA) and publishers (MIT Press, Hauser & Wirth, White Cube). Capabilities span identity systems, publication design, exhibition/spatial design, wayfinding, type design (custom typefaces), and web design, as well as Graphic design (jonathan-tagged); Autonomy 5 as founder-directed studio with 15+ years of practice.",
      "source_url": "https://kellenberger-white.com/",
